{"id":514,"doub_id":514,"title":"茜茜公主","years":"1955","class":"剧情","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2160427238.webp","doub_score":8.5,"IMDB_number":"","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"","bianji":"[]","performer":"","language":"","release":"","alias":"","abstract":"《茜茜公主》系列影片包括《茜茜公主》、《年轻的皇后》和《皇后的命运》三部曲。作为系列影片的首部，该片讲述了茜茜公主（罗密·施奈德 Romy Schneider 饰）与奥地利国王弗兰兹·约瑟夫（卡尔亨兹·伯恩 Karlheinz Böhm 饰）邂逅相恋的故事。\n　　茜茜出生在 巴伐利亚的贵族之家，她美艳动人，性格活泼。姨妈苏菲打算安排自己的儿子，即奥地利王位继承人弗兰兹，在他的生日庆典上与茜茜的姐姐海伦订婚。母亲和姐姐带着茜茜赴奥地利参加庆典，调皮的她偷偷溜出去钓鱼，不料却与英俊的国王弗兰兹相遇。茜茜动人的微笑深深击中弗兰兹，让他彻底爱上了天真纯情的茜茜，并不顾一切违背母亲苏菲的旨意，在生日庆典上宣布茜茜才是自己的皇后。虽然有情人终成眷属，但这段浪漫纯真的爱情却是刚刚面临考验。 ","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p549128262.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p549134876.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1478927689.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1570203628.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2028618413.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2160427238.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2500194500.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2178512592.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1vXQobnJ0wPcxuW44PcwJcQ?pwd=7697\",\"size\":\"2.02\",\"date\":\"2025-08-11\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":0}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"","address":" 奥地利","orginName":"《茜茜公主 Sissi》","ratingbetterthan":"","tag":""}